<view class="c2f-page">
  <view class="c2f-system" style="height: {{headerTopPx}}px;"></view>
  <view class="c2f-header" style="height: {{headerRowHeightPx}}px;">
    <button class="c2f-header-back" hover-class="c2f-pressed" bindtap="onHeaderBack" aria-label="返回">
      <view class="c2f-back-icon" aria-hidden="true"></view>
    </button>
    <text class="c2f-header-title">C2f 开发预览</text>
    <view class="c2f-header-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="c2f-scroll" scroll-y="true">
    <view class="c2f-content">
      <text class="c2f-preview-note">{{previewNotice}}</text>
      <text class="c2f-heading">结构化举报与处置</text>
      <text class="c2f-copy">选择一个可重复状态，检查举报填写、结果恢复和平台结论文案。</text>

      <view class="c2f-scenario-list">
        <button
          wx:for="{{screens}}"
          wx:key="scenario"
          class="c2f-scenario-card"
          hover-class="c2f-pressed"
          bindtap="onOpenScenario"
          data-scenario="{{item.scenario}}"
          aria-label="打开{{item.title}}"
        >
          <view class="c2f-scenario-copy">
            <text>{{item.title}}</text>
            <text>{{item.detail}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="c2f-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></view>
        </button>
      </view>

      <view class="c2f-boundary" aria-role="note">
        <text>预览边界</text>
        <text>本页只读取隔离 Fixture；正式版本将接入真实报名资格与平台审计。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
